Dock appears instantly when auto-hidden\tcom.apple.dock\tautohide-delay\tfloat\t0\tDock
No window opening animations\tNSGlobalDomain\tNSAutomaticWindowAnimationsEnabled\tbool\tfalse\t-
No Finder animations\tcom.apple.finder\tDisableAllAnimations\tbool\ttrue\tFinder
Show hidden files in Finder\tcom.apple.finder\tAppleShowAllFiles\tbool\ttrue\tFinder
Show the folder path bar in Finder\tcom.apple.finder\tShowPathbar\tbool\ttrue\tFinder'

tweak_on() {  # tweak_on DOMAIN KEY TYPE VALUE
